{
  "name": "Exemples Pandoc",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "When clicking 'Test workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputType": "text",
        "inputText": "# Mon Document\n\n## Introduction\n\nCeci est un **test** de conversion Markdown vers HTML.\n\n### Liste\n\n- Item 1\n- Item 2\n- Item 3\n\n```javascript\nconst hello = 'world';\n```",
        "fromFormat": "markdown",
        "toFormat": "html5",
        "outputType": "text",
        "additionalOptions": {
          "standalone": true,
          "toc": true
        }
      },
      "name": "Markdown → HTML",
      "type": "@neayi/n8n-pandoc.pandoc",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputType": "text",
        "inputText": "== Section principale ==\n\n'''Texte en gras''' et ''texte en italique''.\n\n=== Sous-section ===\n\n* Liste 1\n* Liste 2\n\n[[Lien]] vers une page.",
        "fromFormat": "mediawiki",
        "toFormat": "gfm",
        "outputType": "text",
        "additionalOptions": {
          "standalone": false
        }
      },
      "name": "MediaWiki → Markdown",
      "type": "@neayi/n8n-pandoc.pandoc",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputType": "text",
        "inputText": "# Document de test\n\nCe document sera converti en DOCX.",
        "fromFormat": "markdown",
        "toFormat": "docx",
        "outputType": "binary",
        "outputBinaryPropertyName": "document",
        "additionalOptions": {
          "standalone": true
        }
      },
      "name": "Markdown → DOCX",
      "type": "@neayi/n8n-pandoc.pandoc",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "jsonToBinary",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "document.docx"
        }
      },
      "name": "Sauvegarder DOCX",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.moveBinaryData",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 600]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputType": "text",
        "inputText": "<html>\n<head><title>Test</title></head>\n<body>\n<h1>Titre</h1>\n<p>Paragraphe avec <strong>texte en gras</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Item 1</li>\n<li>Item 2</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "fromFormat": "html",
        "toFormat": "plain",
        "outputType": "text",
        "additionalOptions": {
          "wrap": "none"
        }
      },
      "name": "HTML → Texte brut",
      "type": "@neayi/n8n-pandoc.pandoc",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 800]
    }
  ],
